    "steam_appid": 2865360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865360/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1711741084\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>&quot;Inline: Out of Time&quot; is an adrenaline-fueled 2D platformer packed with high-speed deliveries, urban parkour, and rail-grinding. Join the ranks of the Inline Initiative as the newest recruit of the logistics company Parcel Dynamics. Immerse yourself in a thrilling race against the clock as you roller-skate through a retro-futuristic cityscape. Master every twist and turn as you optimize your delivery route with one goal in mind: SPEED.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865360/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1711741084\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience <strong>fast-paced roller-skating action</strong> as you deliver packages through a variety of vibrant city environments. <br></li><li>Embrace the <strong>challenge of mastering your routes</strong> by practicing maneuvers such as wall-jumps and long-distance package throws. Remember, speed is your #1 priority, so &quot;THIS SIDE UP&quot; and &quot;FRAGILE&quot; are just light suggestions!<br></li><li>Enjoy our <strong>complimentary music player featuring a full soundtrack</strong> designed to enhance the relentlessly thrilling gameplay. Spanning genres including dance, techno, funk, and electronica, there is something for every speed demon.<br></li><li>After completing your deliveries, feel free to <strong>pet any cats you find </strong>in the city.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865360/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1711741084\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
